,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正式发布Codex Chrome浏览器扩展程序，深度集成Web开发环境</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI推出GPT-5.5-Cyber预览版，面向经审核安全团队限量开放</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic宣布Claude深度集成Microsoft 365，实现跨应用上下文共享</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里妈妈正式发布超级经营智能体引擎“AI 万相”</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dd9a7cae1bb950ed46cb2400cfd64b2f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里妈妈于2026年5月正式推出超级经营智能体引擎“AI 万相”，标志着AI营销正式迈入智能体时代。该引擎由万相智识、万相智品、万相智造和万相智投四大智能体构成，各智能体间可实现高效协同。商家仅需发送简单指令，即可完成从营销到销售的完整闭环。该产品通过重构经营链路，帮助商家精准定位目标消费者，并利用数据分析与智能决策提升市场竞争力。在应用层面，“AI 万相”旨在大幅降低商家人力成本，通过智能化与自动化的运营模式，助力商家在竞争激烈的电商领域实现降本增效。此次发布不仅是阿里妈妈在AI营销领域的重大技术突破，也预示着智能体将成为未来电商运营中不可或缺的经营伙伴，推动行业向智能化经营模式转型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阶跃星辰即将完成25亿美元融资并拆除红筹架构，正式启动赴港IPO进程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/76f3b6d38f111ed03722ecf7108b85e7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">国产大模型公司阶跃星辰即将完成近25亿美元融资，并已完成拆除红筹架构及股改，正式由有限责任公司转变为股份有限公司，迈向香港IPO。本轮融资获得华勤、龙旗、豪威、中兴等多家产业链资本支持，覆盖从整机制造到上游核心器件的多个环节，香港投资管理有限公司（HKIC）亦加入股东名单。此次资本运作与架构调整，标志着阶跃星辰模型能力向终端迁移的战略布局进一步深化。充足的资金将用于后续研发投入与市场扩展，助力公司在激烈的AI竞争中巩固技术优势，并提升其在国际市场的竞争力。这一系列动作不仅反映了资本市场对阶跃星辰技术路径的认可，也为公司后续在港股上市奠定了坚实基础。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正式发布Codex Chrome浏览器扩展程序，深度集成Web开发环境</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日正式上线Codex for Chrome浏览器扩展程序，全面适配macOS与Windows平台，旨在为桌面端用户提供更直接的Codex智能支持。该扩展采用非侵入式设计，支持跨标签页获取上下文信息，并能直接调用开发者工具（DevTools），从而在真实浏览器环境中精准执行Web应用测试及复杂任务。OpenAI团队表示，此举旨在优化“Computer Use”功能下的高频网页工作流，填补传统API难以触及的技术空白。目前Codex周活跃用户已突破400万，较年初增长约8倍。用户即日起可通过Codex应用内的“Plugins”菜单安装该扩展。此次发布不仅简化了普通用户的办公与检索路径，也进一步深耕了开发者市场，通过深度集成浏览器环境，显著提升了AI在网页端处理复杂任务的效率与专业深度。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI推出GPT-5.5-Cyber预览版，面向经审核安全团队限量开放</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/af10758c5260b3022da91c6978f2d32a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于2026年5月7日正式发布GPT-5.5-Cyber预览版，该模型是GPT-5.5的垂直领域专用版本，目前仅向经审核的安全团队限量开放。与通用版模型不同，GPT-5.5-Cyber通过定向训练放宽了处理安全任务时的内置限制，旨在提升授权团队在漏洞识别、补丁验证及恶意软件分析等工作流中的执行效率。OpenAI明确表示，该版本并非用于增强网络攻防能力，而是为了解决通用模型因严苛安全防护机制导致的专业任务执行难度。此次发布紧随Anthropic此前推出的Claude Mythos预览版，标志着大模型厂商正加速从通用能力竞争转向金融、安全等高敏领域的垂直场景适配。随着专用模型在关键基础设施中的渗透，如何在能力释放与风险管控间建立动态平衡，已成为行业合规与技术落地的核心挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic宣布Claude深度集成Microsoft 365，实现跨应用上下文共享</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正式宣布旗下AI助手Claude深度集成至Microsoft 365生态系统，并面向所有付费用户开放。此次更新的核心在于实现“跨应用上下文共享”，Claude能够实时读取并理解Excel、Word和PowerPoint之间的关联数据。在具体应用层面，Claude在Excel中支持构建复杂数据模型，在PowerPoint中可一键生成原生专业图表，在Word中则能以修订模式处理文档反馈并回复评论。通过此次集成，用户无需频繁切换窗口，即可在统一窗口内完成从数据分析到报告生成及幻灯片演示的全流程操作。Claude从单一功能助手进化为具备全局视野的协同者，通过打通跨应用协作流，显著提升了Microsoft 365用户的办公生产力与流程自动化水平。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
